### Page 1 of 1

```text
RESOLUTION NO. ___________
ENTITLED:  “A RESOLUTION CERTIFYING THAT THE GOVERNING BODY OF
THE CITY OF CHEYENNE HAS AGREED ON COUNTY PROJECTS TO
BE SUBMITTED TO THE STATE LOAN AND INVESTMENT BOARD
FOR 2015-2016 COUNTYWIDE CONSENSUS BLOCK GRANT
FUNDING”
Whereas,  the Laramie County Board of Commissioners desire to participate in the State
Loan and Investment Board’s Countywide Consensus Block Grant program; and
Whereas, the rules of the State Loan and Investment Board require that application for
funds under this program be made by the Board of County Commissioners and agreed to by
municipalities representing at least 70% of the county’s incorporated population; and
Whereas, the Governing Body of Cheyenne represents greater than 70% of the
incorporated population of Laramie County; and
Whereas, Laramie County projects are listed on the attached spread sheet entitled
“Laramie County FY 2015/2016 SLIB Consensus.”
THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF
CHEYENNE, WYOMING
That the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne is in agreement with the projects set
forth by the Laramie County Commissioners in the FY 2015 -2016 Countywide Consensus
Block Grant Projects spreadsheet.
PASSED, APPROVED AND ADOPTED THIS 25th DAY OF AUGUST, 2014
Richard L. Kaysen, Mayor
Attest:
Carol Intlekofer, City Clerk
```
